! SPO through focus: FFO/IFO/NFO focus positions.  The rays are moved along
! their slopes to each focus; the spot at FFO 0.1 equals a real retrace with
! the image moved 0.1 (RMS 5.5626058 both ways).
LEN NEW
EPD 20
YAN 0 5
INS S2
RDY S1 120
THI S1 5
GLA S1 NBK7
RDY S2 -50
THI S2 92.3
SPO ; RECTDENS 6 ; GO
! SPO (FLD) honours FFO
FFO 0.1
SPO FLD ; RECTDENS 6 ; GO
FFO 0
THI S2 92.4
SPO ; RECTDENS 6 ; GO
THI S2 92.3
! through focus: one field, NFO positions in a row (ORI V: a column)
FFO -0.1
IFO 0.1
NFO 3
SPO THF ; SETFLD 2 ; RECTDENS 6 ; GO
SPO THF ; ORI V ; SETWV 1 ; RECTDENS 6 ; GO
! bad input
SPO SIDEWAYS ; GO
SPO ; ORI V ; GO
SPO THF ; ORI DIAGONAL ; GO
